                    <signifLet xml:id="m-7d0b39ec-8974-4289-aff6-77d3275cc7f3" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-5958be82-f7a4-49dd-b567-c1fb4c2214dd" facs="#m-292374e7-e7f4-45d5-a0b0-3401a364180f" form="minima" /><custos xml:id="m-9b8fc99f-2c01-485b-9a24-f04828c17a29" facs="#m-333e2ae9-a503-49a2-9d72-7e7199e3bc1a" pname="c" oct="4" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-9f251705-225e-402a-b550-4cf95390f758"><lg xml:id="m-0b89ae26-41d7-49c0-93c8-87783fb5041b"><l xml:id="m-f1c2797e-29fb-45c5-8dff-97ce507beb0a" facs="#m-675ccf07-8d5f-4ade-a648-28cedbe24ece" label="ambiguous">14954</l><l xml:id="m-71206bef-8ef9-4c09-a9a8-15209d854c98" facs="#m-63b99b27-cc27-484a-8773-6802eb31a684" label="ambiguous">June 22.</l><l xml:id="m-655296d5-08f0-4cb0-916d-a17c2cb8e01f" facs="#m-84dc35f9-df25-4246-b747-3eeb112418e0" label="lyrics-like">tú- i. Ps. Meménto Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-a1ef4bb1-7e21-44c8-8a7a-8b92105e7d53" facs="#m-6df3e5fc-7a31-44d2-af21-280bffdb0c78" label="lyrics-like">em Chrí-sti</l><l xml:id="m-77345ea7-4f1d-42d0-9fcc-5d8ec4ca567c" facs="#m-26fda231-1fbf-4e50-ac8f-84e315420e89" label="lyrics-like">tas fá¬ ci¬</l><l xml:id="m-bbfa9c0d-816b-4ced-83b1-7b8d1f8404c5" facs="#m-ce5fc6fe-96fe-45e9-9045-4694f8da07ce" label="lyrics-like">mine Dá-vid:* et ómnis mansu-e-tú-di-nis é-jus. Gló-ri-a</l><l xml:id="m-0ca08d2a-98bd-44e6-8531-2961d49b4d58" facs="#m-96a3756f-a085-4b6f-802f-d64b85e39615" label="lyrics-like">Pátri. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-3c0cfe9c-9dd9-4630-8a75-2915729be5d2" facs="#m-494825be-1d22-45b8-a9b1-0b6b0d752484" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-45c784a7-26d4-4145-b2d8-74d982d1e398" facs="#m-329984fb-9138-4a7c-a0d6-1ad3ce465efd" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui ómnia pro te in hoc linhaeréntes, *valeámus terréna</l><l xml:id="m-47e23fee-4e4f-4faa-beeb-2754c8b1bb8e" facs="#m-a2d94510-5a05-4d3a-abda-f4734b1bacea" label="lyrics-like">despicere, et sola caeléstia deside¬</l><l xml:id="m-f1a414b8-4fa1-47c0-a081-9b95961d36eb" facs="#m-dab7c05c-bc78-4284-a1e1-294e228e942d" label="lyrics-like">I saéculo relinquéntibus, céntu¬</l><l xml:id="m-16e98b28-783c-4cfe-bbf0-20ebaec846b8" facs="#m-dda87e1e-6c14-471d-b432-027e4a854f44" label="lyrics-like">ráre. Qui vivis et regnas cum Deo</l><l xml:id="m-a51d29bb-41f6-4c1d-8e18-84485bc9637b" facs="#m-0d137365-a6b5-4747-b296-521e6b0f43e4" label="lyrics-like">plum in futúro et vitam aetérnam</l><l xml:id="m-71724752-f22d-45f3-8d2f-622543883213" facs="#m-a70370c2-58e5-4620-a73e-ffc47b02731c" label="lyrics-like">promisisti: t concéde propitius; ut</l><l xml:id="m-d1be3047-b3f7-4599-be4c-8fff5699907a" facs="#m-02a004b1-49bc-4051-b75b-21f3789616ae" label="ambiguous">Patre.</l><l xml:id="m-b996a48f-feee-4f89-928d-c500ede8d482" facs="#m-60eedc0a-c008-4365-8ec5-22eae3baf985" label="ambiguous">sancti Pontificis Paulini vestigiis</l><l xml:id="m-2fca552b-2b39-42f9-b153-83c044dd88d8" facs="#m-0336fc87-b0c8-479e-bd08-a2cfeeff09ae" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Corinthios.</l><l xml:id="m-4c88aa1b-83a9-4240-bb0d-0d4cacd211ef" facs="#m-b1e0966d-2594-43f9-b641-1d5ca86e4e4d" label="ambiguous">2 Cor. 8, 9-15.</l><l xml:id="m-a8acaa47-853f-4a84-96f6-9cf7b368727b" facs="#m-2a1329c2-b76a-4ad3-a78d-012270d64cf9" label="lyrics-like">TRatres: Scitis grátiam Dómini l est, secúndum id quod habet, ac¬</l><l xml:id="m-41e4faee-c025-4fea-a2d3-ddc863a85013" facs="#m-bfd54df5-30a7-4637-aea8-827d434a65bb" label="lyrics-like">nostri Jesu Christi, quóniam ] cépta est, non secúndum id quod</l><l xml:id="m-52f8cc48-a14b-4fb7-9859-3eab6bb01042" facs="#m-87439e4a-de69-4c00-95a6-e7f0aea22846" label="lyrics-like">non habet. Non enim ut áliis sit</l><l xml:id="m-432698c4-8960-4790-8f26-3a4311a8b2ed" facs="#m-d805cd8f-de7d-4075-bc31-c35a07756e14" label="lyrics-like">propter vos egénus factus est, cum</l><l xml:id="m-02c3f45c-caf5-46da-844a-f4cefcf9d3ad" facs="#m-edbeb3aa-409e-4333-8547-17e5b621cef7" label="lyrics-like">remíssio, vobis autem tribulátio,</l><l xml:id="m-d50a1318-e7dc-4fd4-86a7-e1e8c9212c7e" facs="#m-508e0fd2-d6b3-4fb1-b673-67085bd8920d" label="lyrics-like">esset dives, ut illíus inópia vos di¬</l><l xml:id="m-c6494e92-5e22-4488-b1a9-7fca733627d1" facs="#m-4df793ea-886b-407a-a894-eae773e86e65" label="lyrics-like">vites essétis. Et consilium in hoc</l><l xml:id="m-98acd89c-1a4d-439f-9ed4-8593bca7d96c" facs="#m-22ffeffa-ce03-4057-955b-999bdb9d25da" label="lyrics-like">sed ex aequalitáte. In praesénti</l><l xml:id="m-558daca1-32fe-4e32-844f-ec7f21de254c" facs="#m-f8d9306a-bebf-4ae4-9dc4-0d1395ab6ee4" label="lyrics-like">do: hoc enim vobis útile est, qui</l><l xml:id="m-5269d044-08f6-4ee1-8e9b-c8d147b279bd" facs="#m-69d2ed1d-59a8-4f84-ba40-5317af3dcae8" label="lyrics-like">témpore vestra abundántia illórum</l><l xml:id="m-0d6f9ce3-e559-4e7f-a294-75f218a2fa32" facs="#m-e502375b-513f-4d04-a2bb-3320e6b1bc95" label="lyrics-like">inópiam súppleat: ut et illórum</l><l xml:id="m-80d673fb-1014-4d0e-9804-febef530bcd3" facs="#m-a8c6e937-8574-4732-8535-55b718653791" label="lyrics-like">non solum fácere, sed et velle coe¬</l><l xml:id="m-f9cc601e-245f-4a5c-b8a3-8beab2f0c2ce" facs="#m-6b7f2177-63d2-4e70-bac8-24310307d9e4" label="lyrics-like">pístis ab anno prióre: nunc vero et</l><l xml:id="m-bf4c7b6d-e67c-44e7-be17-249355ad8c0f" facs="#m-1dc39b75-012f-4558-b985-9825ce6ef6f6" label="lyrics-like">abundántia vestrae inópiae sit sup¬</l><l xml:id="m-5d2cde60-85fa-49ec-80a7-21d0259429ba" facs="#m-eed90f5f-5359-476c-a262-9cb6fc7dc735" label="lyrics-like">facto perficite: ut quemádmodum</l><l xml:id="m-78b2ff06-55ec-4abb-bbd4-de0f59a5ffdf" facs="#m-ecb9c0b0-7c6d-46d7-83c7-99be595e3026" label="lyrics-like">pleméntum, ut fiat aequálitas, sicut</l><l xml:id="m-aec3ff7f-4f02-4883-a877-41172ef48eec" facs="#m-04b213c1-34ad-41d9-ad6d-b3827b866ecf" label="lyrics-like">promptus est ánimus voluntátis,</l><l xml:id="m-f56540c2-564d-4ff4-aa6f-b10635989a47" facs="#m-24ecc718-d855-46a1-8376-37ffa20ea8db" label="ambiguous">scriptum est: Qui multum, non</l><l xml:id="m-63fc901c-274a-4fe1-b188-4b47446a1c32" facs="#m-6e409330-b7f8-45a1-bb17-1300a96150e4" label="lyrics-like">ita sit et perficiéndi ex eo quod</l><l xml:id="m-9df0cd55-4dd1-4f2e-88ed-8373c7233d00" facs="#m-f09b261b-80da-4e60-a7ee-aa2796e901a8" label="lyrics-like">abundávit: et qui módicum, non</l><l xml:id="m-f425e845-61ca-4397-90a2-bd8a932ac081" facs="#m-881cdc72-989f-4385-be2e-9db4240d5003" label="lyrics-like">habétis. Si enim volúntas prompta minorávit.</l><l xml:id="m-79633a4e-efa1-4473-8860-ef145aa649fa" facs="#m-84d2cd02-8072-4444-98b4-ca2c05cbbc19" label="ambiguous">Grad.8</l><l xml:id="m-6afb16a6-ee72-4807-9c22-02a1ba79af3c" facs="#m-2361ef4e-ce99-47b7-aa2b-8481a35ad8cc" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-daaa4d2a-ced7-4cf2-83f1-23efbbcaf6f3" facs="#m-016a592c-cd2a-468c-ba4a-19975fba6477" label="lyrics-like">C-ce * sacérdos má¬</l><l xml:id="m-b6b0a511-b510-4dc0-a463-eb3f0cd1e195" facs="#m-6aca8ed4-f80f-483d-b480-d34dacc7e536" label="lyrics-like">gnus, qui in di-é¬</l><l xml:id="m-aeaeb124-872b-4609-a721-6a9974666077" facs="#m-03f20e5f-fc13-4a0a-995a-374e3acd78a8" label="lyrics-like">bus sú¬</l><l xml:id="m-04360098-2096-4b85-aa87-1952dd85f4cc" facs="#m-772454c5-0431-4442-af06-b83dda59011f" label="lyrics-like">is plá¬ cu¬it</l><l xml:id="m-1fea1e71-015d-4551-8fa4-0e3df48289ad" facs="#m-39becbf2-3f10-4508-910f-3be7805d2968" label="lyrics-like">Dé¬ o</l><l xml:id="m-09f4aca1-5e6e-47ef-8496-3e9d2e927a7e" facs="#m-11e31ee5-ed7f-48b9-a95a-392d1f123931" label="lyrics-like">V. Non est invéntus sími-lis fl-li,</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
